    <string name="setup_help_settings">Open Settings, go to System, then About. Find the line named Build and press OK on it 7 times. A message says you are now a developer.</string>
    <string name="setup_help_wireless">In Developer options, scroll to Wireless debugging and switch it on. If the TV asks about Wi-Fi, choose Allow.</string>
    <string name="setup_help_pair">Keep the phone on the same Wi-Fi as the TV. If the QR will not scan, type the short address into the phone\'s browser. If the TV\'s pairing code times out, open Pair device with pairing code again.</string>
    <string name="setup_help_allow">Choose Always allow from this computer on the TV\'s prompt, then OK. If no prompt appears, switch Wireless debugging off and on again.</string>
